        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I finally was able to reproduce, so thanks for this interesting find! It seems like you didn't explicitly set `showtabline` option to 2 (meaning \"show always\"), which I, for some weird reason, assumed anyone would do :) Instead, 'bufferline.nvim' sets it for you, which happens during Starter buffer being opened. I updated logic and tested, which seemed to work. Could you, please, test with latest `main` branch?",
